# Build context is default-denied, then explicitly allowed — the same
# allow-list posture the repository applies to tool permissions.
#
# This file is load-bearing, not cosmetic. Without it `docker build .` uploads
# ~28,000 ignored files to the daemon (24,194 under tools/graphify/ and 3,652
# under .opencode/node_modules/) plus target/, .git/ and .graphify/, to build a
# jar from four source files.
*

# Everything the image build actually reads.
!pom.xml
!checkstyle.xml
!mvnw
!.mvn
!src
